</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 5:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Then You tell me your thoughts on why he stopped<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11411-->
<!--Post: 11415--><!--Time: 1110685301-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11415"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 7:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I suspect the BTK Strangler ceased communicating with the Wichita Police Department and the media in the late 1970s to avoid apprehension. The BTK Strangler was careful in the 1970s to satisfy his desire to control and dominate the victims, police and media and avoid apprehension. He most probably believed the Wichita Police Department considered him a suspect. He thought ending the communication would reduce the risk of capture.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
