<!--Post: 11429--><!--Time: 1110695948-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11429"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe he stopped communicating with police because he started a family in the 70&#39;s. After the birth of his own children and the realization of what he did to the Otero children, he actually did start fighting the monster in his head and stopped communicating with police.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11429-->
<!--Post: 11433--><!--Time: 1110702854-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11433"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 13, 2005 - 12:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky, c&#39;mon man he didn&#39;t stop communicating after he had his family he started. <BR> His son was born in July of 1975 and his Fox call was in december 1977, his Shirley Locks poem was in January 1978, his Death to Nancy poem and the communication that he named himself BTK was in February 1978.  <BR>His daughter was born in June of 1978 and the Anna Williams note in Anna&#39;s house was found in April 1979 and two days after his daughters first birthday the Oh Anna poem was recieved. By this time his son is almsot four years old. <BR>As far as stopping communicating with the police goes he never started communicating with them. Only once did they recieve anything from him directly that we know of and that was in June of 2004 outlining the Otero murders. Media and other individuals recieved all of the communications. The only other communication directed to the authorities was the 911 Nancy Fox phonebooth call. <BR>Five of the 10 murders he is charged with occured after his son was born that doesnt include the attempeted murder of Kevin Bright and the aborted attempt on Anna Williams. Three of those murders and and the Anna Williams attempt were after his daughter was born. We&#39;ve heard that police think he&#39;s reasponsible for three more although he&#39;s not been charged with that occured after he started his family so he never started fighting the monster. In fact there never was a monster. The monster was him. He knew what he could or couldn&#39;t do or get away with at all times without regard to his family. <BR>Why did he stop communicating from 1979 until 2004? He didn&#39;t want to push his luck in stealth communications. He knew he would always need to kill and didn&#39;t want to risk anything that would stop that and more communications would not only be risky by pushing his luck it would also make it less easier for him to find victims. <BR>Why did he start communicating again? Who knows. Turning 59 maybe. Probably a whole series of life&#39;s events that came into play that triggered his need for the thrill of eluding capture and maybe hoping somewhere deep inside that he would be captured.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11433-->
<!--Post: 11435--><!--Time: 1110706326-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11435"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:crazyhorse4440@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lola<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lola<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 13, 2005 - 1:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What if another Killer, someone Rader had looked up to and was seeking advice from, got a little upset that Rader was stealing his thunder, and Told Rader if you don&#39;t knock it off I will make you one of My victims. What do you all think? Sense we know he was communicating with other killer&#39;s <BR> <BR>Embersage - how do we know that BTK was communicating with another killer?  Can you please verify that statement? <BR>As for BTK being bullied by another serial killer - I find that line of thought to be highly unusual&#40;and humorous&#41;. <BR>Just my humble opinion <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11435-->
<!--Post: 11437--><!--Time: 1110714871-->
